%t = (): CLEAR
%t = (x=>1): CLEAR STORE(x,1)
delete during each: FIRSTKEY NEXTKEY(a) DELETE(b) NEXTKEY(b) NEXTKEY(c)
each (list ctx): NEXTKEY(a) FETCH(b)
each (scalar ctx): FIRSTKEY
each after list-assign: FIRSTKEY FETCH(x) NEXTKEY(x)
if (%t): SCALAR
keys (scalar): FIRSTKEY NEXTKEY(a) NEXTKEY(b) NEXTKEY(c)
keys (void):
scalar(%t): SCALAR
